      "text": "[4:55PM] #LagosAbeokutaExpress #Dopemu #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic is good as you leave Ile-Zik inwards Mangoro, Cement, Saw Mill approaching MRS from where it starts to get a bit slow all the way to Dopemu underneath the bridge.\n\nTraffic on the Dopemu bridge is good as well.\n\nMoving to Akowonjo Roundabout as well as Shasha Roundabout is good.\n\nOur Men are strategically positioned to ensure traffic is good.\n\n @Sola_Giwa @gm_lastma @followlasg @GoldmyneTV @Mr_JAGs @gbenga_omo @TrafficChiefNG @channelstv @lagosMOT1 @lagostraffic961 @daily_trust @thecableng @walemusa @seunosiyemi_ @vanguardngrnews @MobilePunch @NigeriaNewsdesk @TheNationNews @GuardianNigeria @FRSCNigeria @Gidi_Traffic",
