      "text": "[6:15PM] #LagosAbeokutaExpress #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic is a bit slow from Oshodi underneath the bridge inwards Brown junction after which it is better inwards Ladipo, Shogunle, PWD, Airport bus stop, National moving inwards Ajayi Farm through the Ikeja Overpass.\n\nIt is a lot better to Ile Zik.\n\n @Sola_Giwa @gm_lastma @followlasg @GoldmyneTV @Mr_JAGs @gbenga_omo @TrafficChiefNG @channelstv @lagosMOT1 @lagostraffic961 @daily_trust @thecableng @walemusa @seunosiyemi_ @vanguardngrnews @MobilePunch @NigeriaNewsdesk @TheNationNews @GuardianNigeria @FRSCNigeria @Gidi_Traffic",
